{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/Steam_Library_Hero.png?t=1740421307\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve had a long journey to get to this point, adventurer, stay a while and rest. You\u2019ll be fighting hordes of enemies, making friends along the way, and gaining favor for the gods, but I promise that you will get through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things you can do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hear townspeople complain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the mass population of every monster you come across.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the legendary hero to recolor the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things you cannot do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impress the gods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive your past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move the crates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to explore vast lands and eradicate all who stand in your way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/extras/Lantern.gif?t=1740421307\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498310?t=1740421307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/5ab2cf2e73345875349a009ef3bc927b3d18be2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740421307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498310/aa44813d6ca8203fd856bc12b68203901ed18217/caps